I submitted the vulnerability report via email on November 28, 2025, and followed up with 7 reminder emails. 
I received a reply on December 16, 2025: "Thanks for this report - our team is triaging and will take action if we believe it to be a legitimate security issue."
After that, I sent 3 more follow-up emails but received no further response.
